<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Review PJOK SMA Semester 1 — Media Interaktif</title>
  <!-- Font & Ikon -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700;14..32,800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f0f7ff 0%, #e6f0fa 100%);
      color: #0b2b4a;
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 16px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .app {
      max-width: 1200px;
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-radius: 36px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 40, 80, 0.35);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 28px 28px 36px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    /* ---------- Header / Navigasi ---------- */
    .top-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand i {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #1e6f9f;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0, 80, 130, 0.1);
    }

    .brand h1 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b3b5e, #1e6f9f);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .nav-menu {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .nav-menu button {
      background: #ffffffd9;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #11527a;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 30, 60, 0.06);
      transition: all 0.18s;
      border: 1px solid rgba(30, 111, 159, 0.15);
    }

    .nav-menu button i {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .nav-menu button:hover {
      background: #fff;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 18px -8px rgba(30, 111, 159, 0.3);
      border-color: #1e6f9f;
      color: #0a3b5a;
    }

    .nav-menu button.active {
      background: #1e6f9f;
      color: white;
      border-color: #1e6f9f;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 16px -6px #1e6f9f;
    }

    /* ---------- Halaman Konten ---------- */
    .page {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.35s ease;
    }

    .page.active-page {
      display: block;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
      100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 26px 28px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0, 60, 100, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid #ffffffd0;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card-header i {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #1e6f9f;
      background: #e7f0fa;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .card-header h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #083b58;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .card-header h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0b4b70;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ff9f1c;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Grid bola besar / kecil */
    .sport-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .sport-item {
      background: #f9fdff;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #d9e9f5;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .sport-item:hover {
      border-color: #1e6f9f;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 20px -12px #1e6f9f;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .sport-item h4 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0b3b5e;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #ff9f1c;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .sport-item h4 i {
      color: #1e6f9f;
    }

    .sport-item ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .sport-item li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .sport-item li i {
      color: #1e6f9f;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .pill {
      background: #e7f0fa;
      padding: 2px 12px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0d5279;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    /* Tabel kebugaran */
    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-radius: 18px;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      background: white;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    th {
      background: #1e6f9f;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    td {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e9f5;
    }

    tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .fitt-badge {
      background: #ff9f1c20;
      border-left: 4px solid #ff9f1c;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #7a4b00;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    /* ---------- Kuis ---------- */
    .quiz-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .progress-badge {
      background: #e7f0fa;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0d5279;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .question-box {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 22px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 50, 90, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid #d9e9f5;
    }

    .q-text {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: #083b58;
    }

    .options {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .option {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      background: #f7fcff;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1.5px solid #d9e9f5;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }

    .option:hover {
      border-color: #1e6f9f;
      background: #e7f0fa;
    }

    .option.selected {
      border-color: #1e6f9f;
      background: #d4e8fa;
    }

    .option input[type="radio"] {
      accent-color: #1e6f9f;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .option label {
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      flex: 1;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .feedback {
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .feedback.correct {
      background: #e2f7e9;
      color: #0a6e3e;
      border-left: 5px solid #1e9e5a;
    }

    .feedback.wrong {
      background: #ffe8e8;
      color: #9e1e1e;
      border-left: 5px solid #d43d3d;
    }

    .btn {
      border: none;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.18s;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: white;
      color: #0b3b5e;
      border: 1.5px solid #b8d6ea;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 40, 80, 0.04);
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #e7f0fa;
      border-color: #1e6f9f;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #1e6f9f;
      border-color: #1e6f9f;
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px -6px #1e6f9f;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #0e527c;
      border-color: #0e527c;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-orange {
      background: #ff9f1c;
      border-color: #ff9f1c;
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 14px -6px #ff9f1c;
    }

    .btn-orange:hover {
      background: #e88a0b;
      border-color: #e88a0b;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-sm {
      padding: 8px 18px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .quiz-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* Hasil */
    .result-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin: 22px 0;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: #f7fcff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid #d9e9f5;
    }

    .stat-card .value {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #1e6f9f;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .stat-card .label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #4b6d85;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    }

    /* refleksi */
    .reflection-item {
      background: #f7fcff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #d9e9f5;
    }

    .reflection-item p {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0b3b5e;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .reflection-item textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1.5px solid #c8ddec;
      padding: 14px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      resize: vertical;
      background: white;
      transition: 0.15s;
    }

    .reflection-item textarea:focus {
      border-color: #1e6f9f;
      outline: none;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(30, 111, 159, 0.2);
    }

    /* cover */
    .cover-hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 10px 10px;
    }

    .cover-hero h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b3b5e, #1e6f9f, #ff9f1c);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .cover-hero p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #2b5779;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .icon-sports {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 30px 0;
      font-size: 3.2rem;
      color: #1e6f9f;
    }

    .icon-sports i {
      background: #ffffffd0;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -8px #1e6f9f60;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .icon-sports i:hover {
      transform: scale(1.08) translateY(-4px);
      color: #ff9f1c;
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 32px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #5f7e96;
      border-top: 1px solid #d9e9f5;
      padding-top: 22px;
    }

    .footer-note strong {
      color: #1e6f9f;
    }

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .app { padding: 18px; }
      .brand h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
      .card { padding: 18px; }
      .card-header h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .cover-hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
      .nav-menu button { padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
      .nav-menu button i { font-size: 0.9rem; }
      .icon-sports { font-size: 2.2rem; gap: 14px; }
      .icon-sports i { padding: 12px; }
    }

    /* util */
    .hidden { display: none; }
    .text-center { text-align: center; }
    .mt-2 { margin-top: 12px; }
    .mt-3 { margin-top: 22px; }
    .mb-2 { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .flex { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <!-- ================= HEADER ================= -->
  <div class="top-bar">
    <div class="brand">
      <i class="fas fa-dumbbell"></i>
      <h1>REVIEW PJOK SMA</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-menu" id="navMenu">
      <button data-page="cover" class="active"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Cover</button>
      <button data-page="tujuan"><i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i> Tujuan</button>
      <button data-page="bolabesar"><i class="fas fa-futbol"></i> Bola Besar</button>
      <button data-page="bolakecil"><i class="fas fa-table-tennis"></i> Bola Kecil</button>
      <button data-page="kebugaran"><i class="fas fa-heartbeat"></i> Kebugaran</button>
      <button data-page="kuis"><i class="fas fa-question-circle"></i> Kuis</button>
      <button data-page="hasil"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i> Hasil</button>
      <button data-page="refleksi"><i class="fas fa-pen"></i> Refleksi</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= PAGE: COVER ================= -->
  <div class="page active-page" id="page-cover">
    <div class="cover-hero">
      <h1>REVIEW PJOK<br>SEMESTER 1</h1>
      <p>Media Pembelajaran Interaktif untuk SMA</p>
      <div class="icon-sports">
        <i class="fas fa-futbol"></i>
        <i class="fas fa-volleyball"></i>
        <i class="fas fa-basketball"></i>
        <i class="fas fa-table-tennis"></i>
        <i class="fas fa-baseball-ball"></i>
        <i class="fas fa-running"></i>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" onclick="navigateTo('tujuan')">
        <i class="fas fa-play"></i> Mulai Pembelajaran
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-note">
      <strong>OLAHRAGA BUKAN HANYA TENTANG KEMENANGAN, TETAPI JUGA TENTANG KESEHATAN, DISIPLIN, KERJA SAMA, DAN SPORTIVITAS.</strong>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= PAGE: TUJUAN ================= -->
  <div class="page" id="page-tujuan">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i>
        <h2>Tujuan Pembelajaran</h2>
      </div>
      <ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 12px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1e6f9f; margin-top:4px;"></i> Menjelaskan pengertian dan karakteristik permainan bola besar dan bola kecil.</li>
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 12px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1e6f9f; margin-top:4px;"></i> Mengidentifikasi teknik dasar berbagai permainan olahraga.</li>
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 12px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1e6f9f; margin-top:4px;"></i> Memahami komponen dan manfaat kebugaran jasmani.</li>
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 12px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1e6f9f; margin-top:4px;"></i> Menjelaskan prinsip latihan kebugaran jasmani (FITT).</li>
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 12px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1e6f9f; margin-top:4px;"></i> Menunjukkan sikap sportif, disiplin, kerja sama, dan tanggung jawab.</li>
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 12px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1e6f9f; margin-top:4px;"></i> Menyelesaikan evaluasi pembelajaran dengan baik.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i>
        <h3>Aktivitas Interaktif</h3>
      </div>
      <p><strong>Tebak Teknik Dasar:</strong> Sebutkan 3 teknik dasar sepak bola, bola voli, dan bola basket secara bergantian dengan teman sebangku!</p>
      <p class="mt-2"><strong>Diskusi Kelompok:</strong> Apa perbedaan utama antara permainan bola besar dan bola kecil? Diskusikan!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= PAGE: BOLA BESAR ================= -->
  <div class="page" id="page-bolabesar">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <i class="fas fa-futbol"></i>
        <h2>Permainan Bola Besar</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Permainan bola besar adalah cabang olahraga permainan yang menggunakan bola berukuran relatif besar dan biasanya dimainkan secara beregu.</p>
      <div class="sport-grid">
        <!-- Sepak Bola -->
        <div class="sport-item">
          <h4><i class="fas fa-futbol"></i> Sepak Bola</h4>
          <p><strong>Pengertian:</strong> Permainan beregu yang bertujuan memasukkan bola ke gawang lawan sebanyak-banyaknya dan mempertahankan gawang sendiri.</p>
          <p class="mt-2"><span class="pill">Teknik Dasar</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Passing (mengoper bola)</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Dribbling (menggiring bola)</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Shooting (menendang ke gawang)</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Controlling (mengontrol bola)</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Heading (menyundul bola)</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Throw-in (lemparan ke dalam)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2"><span class="pill">Peraturan</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> 11 pemain per tim</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Durasi 2 × 45 menit</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Tidak boleh main bola dengan tangan (kecuali kiper & lemparan ke dalam)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <!-- Bola Voli -->
        <div class="sport-item">
          <h4><i class="fas fa-volleyball"></i> Bola Voli</h4>
          <p><strong>Pengertian:</strong> Permainan beregu yang bertujuan menjatuhkan bola di daerah permainan lawan melewati net.</p>
          <p class="mt-2"><span class="pill">Teknik Dasar</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Passing bawah</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Passing atas</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Servis bawah & atas</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Smash / spike</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Block / bendungan</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2"><span class="pill">Peraturan</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> 6 pemain per tim</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Sistem rally point</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Satu set hingga 25 poin (selisih minimal 2), set penentuan 15 poin</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <!-- Basket -->
        <div class="sport-item">
          <h4><i class="fas fa-basketball"></i> Bola Basket</h4>
          <p><strong>Pengertian:</strong> Permainan beregu yang bertujuan memasukkan bola ke keranjang lawan untuk memperoleh poin.</p>
          <p class="mt-2"><span class="pill">Teknik Dasar</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Dribbling (memantulkan bola)</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Passing (mengoper bola)</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Shooting (menembak ke ring)</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Lay-up</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Pivot</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Rebound</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2"><span class="pill">Peraturan</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> 5 pemain per tim</li>
